&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a trusted sparring partner to executives, steer complex transformation programs across functions, and drive organizational change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Transformation Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer end-to-end execution of enterprise-level AI transformations. Identify internal champions, navigate corporate politics, manage structural blockers, and drive measurable user adoption and organizational change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; AI Use Case Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders to answer high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape their business models? How should they govern data? You don&#39;t just advise; you help evaluate model choices, discuss data privacy trade-offs, and conceptualize technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive the growth of our German practice. Take ownership in lead generation and pipeline conversion by engaging prospective clients, shaping proposals, and leading pre-sales and key-account expansion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Artefact&#39;s AI Transformation perspective externally. Advance our voice in enterprise AI through expert discussions, content creation (e.g. LinkedIn, whitepapers), and opinionated, hands-on perspectives on applied AI trends and real-world adoption pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our methodologies, tools, and frameworks to keep our offering state-of-the-art. Develop reusable transformation playbooks and bring your strategic consulting or technology expertise into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior advisor and role model - leading, coaching, and mentoring agile, hybrid project teams (consultants, data scientists, and engineers), fostering a fast-paced, “can-do” culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; You are a true team player, eager to support others while scaling both the company and your own career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have approximately 5–8 years of full-time working experience in top-tier management consulting, technology consulting, or strategic corporate in-house roles. A proven track record of successfully leading and delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation programs, with the ability to manage executive stakeholders, navigate corporate politics, and embed AI capabilities within client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency &amp;amp; &quot;Builder Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in modern and applied AI (e.g., GenAI, LLMs, agentic systems, automated workflows). While you don&#39;t need to be a full-time programmer, you have a hands-on understanding and can credibly demo working AI concepts and discuss data privacy and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge about common machine learning techniques, cloud architectures, and data management principles. Excellent quantitative skills to draw strategic insights from complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication, presentation, and moderation skills. You have a strong presence and can translate complex technical topics into compelling arguments for non-technical senior executives, as well as bridge the gap to technical execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent academic track record with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) is mandatory to successfully advise our German clients and lead workshops. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact sits uniquely at the crossroads of top-tier business strategy and deep tech. You will build boardroom-level strategy expertise while staying at the absolute forefront of AI, data management, and digital value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Freedom:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a fast-growing team in Germany, you will have high visibility from day one. You will directly help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region, bringing in your own ideas and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Constant exposure to new AI solutions at the intersection of technology and business. Access to regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and the latest AI/data capabilities through our global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; We combine a high degree of self-assurance with a supportive, collaborative environment. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering real impact - while strongly supporting each other&#39;s personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; &lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a backend-leaning Tech Lead to lead a team of 3-4 engineers and own the tech for a part of Superchat’s product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role: You’ll spend roughly half your time designing and building software and the other half enabling your team to perform at its best. Work directly on architecture, development and important projects while creating the clarity, feedback and environment your engineers need to deliver an excellent product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong, current backend engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bring 3+ years of experience as a Senior or Staff Engineer and remain deeply involved in software development. You are comfortable owning, designing and building crucial parts of production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced with the JVM ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have substantial experience with Java or another JVM language. Kotlin and AWS experience are a plus, since our backend runs on Kotlin/Quarkus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead people.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You may already have worked in a hybrid Tech Lead role, have been an Engineering manager for a short time or be taking your first steps in people leadership after successfully owning projects and architecture. What matters is that you genuiely want to help people grow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong at delivery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know how to turn product goals into reality. You are used to work in fast-paced startups and are a driver to increase velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-minded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You care about solving the customers problem. You engage with product decisions, challenge assumptions constructivly and find pragmatic solutions to build things in a lean way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are able to explain complex technical things in details to Engineers and in an understandable way to non-technical stakeholders. You create alignment and motivate people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited about AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are already using AI in your development workflow and are eager to explore how it can improve engineering speed, quality and the way teams work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure people manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You no longer want to work directly on software. This role requires meaningful, ongoing involvement in architecture, implementation, code review, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hero engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You want to make every important technical decision yourself or become the bottleneck for the team. Your job is to raise the effectiveness of the whole team, not to be the only person who can solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure delivery manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You treat engineering as a ticketing operation focused only on timelines and task tracking instead of product quality, technical health, and team growth. We need engineering leaders, not project coordinators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-only operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You prefer fully remote work and don’t want to actively build relationships and culture in person with the team. We believe strong engineering leadership requires regular in-person collaboration and presence in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend approximately 50% of your time contributing directly to architecture, development, code reviews, and important technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 3-4 engineers and take responsibility for its effectiveness, technical quality, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Product Manager to understand customer problems, shape solutions, scope projects, and set priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear technical direction while enabling engineers to own decisions and develop their judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, give actionable feedback, and support each engineer’s development and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers, manage dependencies, and help the team identify delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering practices and explore effective uses of AI throughout the software-development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring through technical interviews, structured feedback, and candidate conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Your manager and partner on people development, calibration, processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;Engineers in your team; you own their development, performance and growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; PMs own what and why; you own how (delivery) and who (people)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CTO and CPO: &lt;/strong&gt;We are a lean organization with a flat hierarchy. You will regulary disccuss the direction of architecture with the CTO and product with the CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission that matters. &lt;/strong&gt;Real impact on small businesses, not abstract metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Funded with conviction. &lt;/strong&gt;$18M raised and profitable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack. &lt;/strong&gt;Kotlin/Quarkus, AWS, TypeScript/React/Next.js, and LangGraph for AI-powered features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squad-based organization. &lt;/strong&gt;Each squad owns its domain end-to-end with real ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Two clear career tracks&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; We support both individual contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Management Paths with explicit reversibility between both and Tech Lead being the first level of management that is still quite hands-on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-led structure. &lt;/strong&gt;PMs report directly to the CPO, keeping product strategy focused, consistent, and clearly prioritized&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid by design. &lt;/strong&gt;Our Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg is the center of gravity, with two work-from-home days as the standard setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct feedback culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Honest, direct, and kind feedback is part of how we work together - in 1:1s, retrospectives, and everyday collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club/John Reed membership or a public transport/Dance subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget of €500 for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that enables fast professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important to us to create an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together - whether that’s through HYROX training, golfing, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or whatever kind of community you’d like to help build here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with passion, grit, and integrity. You&#39;re encouraged to apply even if your experience doesn&#39;t precisely match the description. At Superchat, we welcome diverse perspectives and people who think rigorously.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocating to Berlin? We support you with practical relocation help. You&#39;ll feel home in no time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With your application you agree to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&quot;&gt;privacy policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Demo Architect, you&#39;ll help GitLab teams and customers get hands-on with our platform faster and with less friction. This role reports to the Senior Director of our Solutions Architecture Center of Excellence, with day-to-day partnership from the current team lead. You&#39;ll build and improve the tools, applications, and infrastructure that support field team demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments across the field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What makes this role unique is its mix of software engineering, infrastructure, and customer-facing collaboration. You&#39;ll work like an engineer for much of the role, while also partnering with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, and others to make sure what we build is practical, usable, and aligned to how the field sells.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain tools, applications, and workflows that support demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand the Demo Architect Portal to improve automation, self-service, and scalability for field teams and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provision and support infrastructure that enables hands-on customer experiences across&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.com&quot;&gt; GitLab.com&lt;/a&gt;, demo instances, and internal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, Marketing, Revenue Operations, UX, and Engineering to understand needs and deliver practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and document go-to-market workflows (e.g., how teams run demos/workshops/trials) and automate the steps that waste time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical workshop assets and enablement content that support pre-sales and technical selling for individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on sales opportunities when specialized technical demo support or custom solutions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the presenter experience by reducing manual setup work and making demo workflows easier to use and repeat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal teams that rely on demo or test infrastructure, helping keep those environments available and useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot urgent demo/workshop environment issues under pressure and communicate status clearly to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software, systems, or internal tools that support technical users or business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deliver production-grade software and automation with attention to reliability, maintainability, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across application development and infrastructure, with comfort navigating provisioning, automation, and service workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with monitoring/observability tools to shorten investigation time when something breaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort communicating and collaborating with technical and non-technical stakeholders across Sales, Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, Marketing, UX, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to design and iterate on solutions for usability and repeatability, not just technical correctness, with awareness that the end user may be a seller or Solutions Architect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a remote, asynchronous environment, with willingness to travel periodically for team offsites and occasional in-person planning/whiteboarding sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to technical demos, workshops, trials, or enablement assets, and/or interest in learning the pre-sales context; transferable experience from software engineering, site reliability engineering, systems engineering, solutions architecture, or similar technical paths.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;#LI-CM1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the Demo Architect team at GitLab, we support the field’s demo, workshop, and trial experiences by maintaining shared tooling and the infrastructure behind internal demo and test instances used across GitLab. We’re a small, globally distributed group that collaborates asynchronously across regions and adapts quickly to changing needs, with a current focus on scaling automation, enabling more self-service, extending support to partners, and maintaining reliable internal infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

